  user_input {
    user_response: "Lets start implementing changes.\n\nGet rid of the \'not amused.\' on top of the logo in the hero.\n\nChange \'This cat is serious\' to \'WAGMI FOR REAL\' with wagmi being the same style as \'serious\' text wise.\n\nChange $SERIOUSCAT to $WAGMI\n\nChange \"The Original Picture of Cash Cat is Serious Cat.\" to \"We\342\200\231re All Gonna Make It.\"\n\nChange \"before the memes. before the money. there was the stare. deployed with a straight face on Robinhood Chain \302\267 trades vs ETH \302\267 contract verified (he checked. twice.)\" with \"No more cope. No more paper hands. Just belief. The coin for diamond hands and delusional optimists.\" Have \'belief\' highlighted in the same green colour. \n\nUnder the text the first button change from \'buy the cat\' to \"grab some wagmi\" and replace the cat emoji with a money emoji. Add another animation on top of the one that exists - when mouse hovers over button it also changes colour to green and text colour to black. \n\nUsing same style as the \'buy the cat\' and \'stare at the chart\' buttons, duplicate them and add them to the navigation on top right. Inside the button replace text of one with Telegram logo and the other X logo.\n\nAt the moment don\'t hyperlink any buttons. \n\nThe copy contract section below the buttons, instead of having a spotted border line, have a green stroke border like in the incinerator section. Inside the border have a subtle green background colour - very subtle like in incinerator section. Remove \'0x196A3Ab28E1e854a040e57576cf94ff99d7F3Acc\' and replace with \'Adding after launch\'. The \'copy it\' button copies whats in the container so \'adding after launch\' for now until i update later. Rename \'CA\' with \'Contract\'. When coopy it button is clicked, the animation is the same but get rid of the cat emoji. When button is clicked instead of showing \'copied\' show \'wagmi\' \n\nChange \'yes, that\'s the real one. the cat does not do fakes.\' with \'The official currency of those who refused to sell the bag.\'\n\nIN the next section, remove \'The incinerator\' title along with the emoji. \n\nMove \'the cat does not pay himself. nobody collects creator fees. ever.\ninstead, 0.7% of every single trade automatically buys $SERIOUSCAT and yeets it straight into the void. gone. deleted. unfollowed from existence. the burner is the registered fee recipient and cannot be changed. this is not a promise \342\200\224 it\'s the contract.\' text inside the green box under the green title and replace text with; \n\n\'We don\342\200\231t need a complicated story.\nWe don\342\200\231t need utility theater.\nWe just believe.\n\nThrough the dumps, the FUD, and the endless cope\342\200\246\nWe stayed.\n\nThis is for the ones who never sold.\nThis is WAGMI.\'\n\nIn the box, replace the number with text \'know your meme\'. Change the fire emoji to smiley with monocle emoji.\n\nRemove \"$SERIOUSCAT sent to the shadow realm\nand they are never coming back\"\n\nRemove the progress bar and the text underneath.\n\nRemove the 2x2 column with the contents inside along with the spotted border box with the contents along with \'live data from...\' text. move the \'know your meme\' button from \'countil of serious business\' section to the \'know your meme\' section under all the text inside the green box. Replace emoji of cat in \'know your meme\' button with a smiley with sunglasses. Hyperlink the button to https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/wagmi-ngmi\n\nchange text from \'the lord. est. 2003. respect your elders.\' to \'the immortal catchphrase\'\n\nIn the next section, rename \'the council of serious business\' to \'the movement\' and have a \'soon\' emoji on the left of it.\n\nChange \'no jokes allowed. okay maybe some jokes. the cat will decide.\' to \'The bags are heavy. The hands are diamond. Come sit with us.\'\n\nremove the dexscreener button, leaving only the X and telegram button. Change the emoji on telegram from plane to the telegram logo.\n\nIn the X button change \'X / Twitter\' to \'X\' and \'@seriouscarth- serious posts only\' to \'@wagmindahood - for the lolz\'\n\nIn the telegram button change \'t.me/seriouscatrh - the war room\' to \'t.me/wagmindahood - autists and believers\'\n\nIn the footer, change \"Serious Cat ($SERIOUSCAT) \302\267 Robinhood Chain \302\267 est. with a straight face\" to \'\302\251 2026 $WAGMI \342\200\224 We\342\200\231re all gonna make it (probably).\'\n\nChange \"this is a community meme token. the cat is serious \342\200\224 you should still be sensible. nothing here is financial advice. crypto is volatile: never invest more than you can afford to lose.\" to \"Built by believers, held by degenerates.\nIf you\342\200\231re reading this, you\342\200\231re already early (or extremely late). DYOR.\""
    items {
      text: "Lets start implementing changes.\n\nGet rid of the \'not amused.\' on top of the logo in the hero.\n\nChange \'This cat is serious\' to \'WAGMI FOR REAL\' with wagmi being the same style as \'serious\' text wise.\n\nChange $SERIOUSCAT to $WAGMI\n\nChange \"The Original Picture of Cash Cat is Serious Cat.\" to \"We\342\200\231re All Gonna Make It.\"\n\nChange \"before the memes. before the money. there was the stare. deployed with a straight face on Robinhood Chain \302\267 trades vs ETH \302\267 contract verified (he checked. twice.)\" with \"No more cope. No more paper hands. Just belief. The coin for diamond hands and delusional optimists.\" Have \'belief\' highlighted in the same green colour. \n\nUnder the text the first button change from \'buy the cat\' to \"grab some wagmi\" and replace the cat emoji with a money emoji. Add another animation on top of the one that exists - when mouse hovers over button it also changes colour to green and text colour to black. \n\nUsing same style as the \'buy the cat\' and \'stare at the chart\' buttons, duplicate them and add them to the navigation on top right. Inside the button replace text of one with Telegram logo and the other X logo.\n\nAt the moment don\'t hyperlink any buttons. \n\nThe copy contract section below the buttons, instead of having a spotted border line, have a green stroke border like in the incinerator section. Inside the border have a subtle green background colour - very subtle like in incinerator section. Remove \'0x196A3Ab28E1e854a040e57576cf94ff99d7F3Acc\' and replace with \'Adding after launch\'. The \'copy it\' button copies whats in the container so \'adding after launch\' for now until i update later. Rename \'CA\' with \'Contract\'. When coopy it button is clicked, the animation is the same but get rid of the cat emoji. When button is clicked instead of showing \'copied\' show \'wagmi\' \n\nChange \'yes, that\'s the real one. the cat does not do fakes.\' with \'The official currency of those who refused to sell the bag.\'\n\nIN the next section, remove \'The incinerator\' title along with the emoji. \n\nMove \'the cat does not pay himself. nobody collects creator fees. ever.\ninstead, 0.7% of every single trade automatically buys $SERIOUSCAT and yeets it straight into the void. gone. deleted. unfollowed from existence. the burner is the registered fee recipient and cannot be changed. this is not a promise \342\200\224 it\'s the contract.\' text inside the green box under the green title and replace text with; \n\n\'We don\342\200\231t need a complicated story.\nWe don\342\200\231t need utility theater.\nWe just believe.\n\nThrough the dumps, the FUD, and the endless cope\342\200\246\nWe stayed.\n\nThis is for the ones who never sold.\nThis is WAGMI.\'\n\nIn the box, replace the number with text \'know your meme\'. Change the fire emoji to smiley with monocle emoji.\n\nRemove \"$SERIOUSCAT sent to the shadow realm\nand they are never coming back\"\n\nRemove the progress bar and the text underneath.\n\nRemove the 2x2 column with the contents inside along with the spotted border box with the contents along with \'live data from...\' text. move the \'know your meme\' button from \'countil of serious business\' section to the \'know your meme\' section under all the text inside the green box. Replace emoji of cat in \'know your meme\' button with a smiley with sunglasses. Hyperlink the button to https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/wagmi-ngmi\n\nchange text from \'the lord. est. 2003. respect your elders.\' to \'the immortal catchphrase\'\n\nIn the next section, rename \'the council of serious business\' to \'the movement\' and have a \'soon\' emoji on the left of it.\n\nChange \'no jokes allowed. okay maybe some jokes. the cat will decide.\' to \'The bags are heavy. The hands are diamond. Come sit with us.\'\n\nremove the dexscreener button, leaving only the X and telegram button. Change the emoji on telegram from plane to the telegram logo.\n\nIn the X button change \'X / Twitter\' to \'X\' and \'@seriouscarth- serious posts only\' to \'@wagmindahood - for the lolz\'\n\nIn the telegram button change \'t.me/seriouscatrh - the war room\' to \'t.me/wagmindahood - autists and believers\'\n\nIn the footer, change \"Serious Cat ($SERIOUSCAT) \302\267 Robinhood Chain \302\267 est. with a straight face\" to \'\302\251 2026 $WAGMI \342\200\224 We\342\200\231re all gonna make it (probably).\'\n\nChange \"this is a community meme token. the cat is serious \342\200\224 you should still be sensible. nothing here is financial advice. crypto is volatile: never invest more than you can afford to lose.\" to \"Built by believers, held by degenerates.\nIf you\342\200\231re reading this, you\342\200\231re already early (or extremely late). DYOR.\""
    }
  }
}
